</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path d="M 48.62 35.43 C 48.62 36.19 48.01 36.81 47.24 36.81 C 46.48 36.81 45.87 36.19 45.87 35.43 C 45.87 34.67 46.48 34.06 47.24 34.06 C 48.01 34.06 48.62 34.67 48.62 35.43 Z M 47.24 35.43"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt" transform="matrix(0.2 0.0 0.0 0.2 45.86 35.43)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="13.84"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
