</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path d="M 95.87 35.43 C 95.87 36.19 95.25 36.81 94.49 36.81 C 93.73 36.81 93.11 36.19 93.11 35.43 C 93.11 34.67 93.73 34.06 94.49 34.06 C 95.25 34.06 95.87 34.67 95.87 35.43 Z M 94.49 35.43"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt" transform="matrix(0.2 0.0 0.0 0.2 93.11 35.43)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="13.84"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
