</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path d="M 119.49 35.43 C 119.49 36.19 118.87 36.81 118.11 36.81 C 117.35 36.81 116.73 36.19 116.73 35.43 C 116.73 34.67 117.35 34.06 118.11 34.06 C 118.87 34.06 119.49 34.67 119.49 35.43 Z M 118.11 35.43"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt" transform="matrix(0.2 0.0 0.0 0.2 116.73 35.43)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="13.84"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
