</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path d="M 150.2 35.43 C 150.2 36.19 149.58 36.81 148.82 36.81 C 148.06 36.81 147.44 36.19 147.44 35.43 C 147.44 34.67 148.06 34.06 148.82 34.06 C 149.58 34.06 150.2 34.67 150.2 35.43 Z M 148.82 35.43"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt" transform="matrix(0.2 0.0 0.0 0.2 147.44 35.43)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="13.84"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
