<p id="S8.p6.2" class="ltx_p">to define a product <math id="S8.p6.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{CH}^{\bullet}(M_{g},\mathbf{V}^{\langle n\rangle})\otimes\mathrm{CH}^{\bullet}(M_{g},\mathbf{V}^{\langle m\rangle})\to\mathrm{CH}^{\bullet}(M_{g},\mathbf{V}^{\langle n+m\rangle})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>CH</mi><mo>∙</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></msup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mi>CH</mi><mo>∙</mo></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msup><mi>CH</mi><mo>∙</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{CH}^{\bullet}(M_{g},\mathbf{V}^{\langle n\rangle})\otimes\mathrm{CH}^{\bullet}(M_{g},\mathbf{V}^{\langle m\rangle})\to\mathrm{CH}^{\bullet}(M_{g},\mathbf{V}^{\langle n+m\rangle})</annotation></semantics></math>. This is associative: the diagram</p>
